+inline constexpr char kAgentTabKey[] = "agens.agent";
+
+// From ChromeBrowserMainPartsMac::PostProfileInit, with the initial profile: when the engine
+// crashed or was killed, each ato that had windows gets its last tabs back (hidden windows; the
+// host sees them as view.tab). After a normal quit nothing comes back by itself and no ato loads:
